//@version=6
// LuxAlgo Meta — small reader that pulls LuxAlgo Signals & Overlays plots and
// emits "bars since last green flip" / "bars since last red flip" so the
// nightly CDP scan can capture flip-age alongside the current signal.
//
// USAGE — add this to a chart that already has "LuxAlgo Signals & Overlays" applied:
//   Settings → set Bullish / Bullish+ / Bearish / Bearish+ to the matching
//   LuxAlgo plot names (the dropdowns will list them).
//
// Output plots (display only in Data Window, never on the chart):
//   "Days Since Green" — bars since the most recent Bullish OR Bullish+ alert
//   "Days Since Red"   — bars since the most recent Bearish OR Bearish+ alert
//
// On the timeframe of the chart, "days" == bars (daily TF → calendar days etc.)
indicator("LuxAlgo Meta", overlay = false, format = format.inherit)

bullish      = input.source(close, "Bullish")
bullish_plus = input.source(close, "Bullish+")
bearish      = input.source(close, "Bearish")
bearish_plus = input.source(close, "Bearish+")

green_fire = bullish == 1 or bullish_plus == 1
red_fire   = bearish == 1 or bearish_plus == 1

days_since_green = ta.barssince(green_fire)
days_since_red   = ta.barssince(red_fire)

plot(days_since_green, "Days Since Green", display = display.data_window)
plot(days_since_red,   "Days Since Red",   display = display.data_window)
